196 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /H2
/P 125 0 R
/T (Socially, the sector presents distinct challenges related to occupational safety, contract labour, and workforce well-being. Manufacturing operations involve high exposure to physical risk, and safety outcomes are closely linked to operational continuity and reputational risk. Gender inclusion also remains a structural challenge within the sector, particularly in shop-floor roles. Given these characteristics, the automobile sector provides a suitable context for examining whether BRSR disclosures meaningfully capture sustainability performance outcomes, and whether reported data can be used to identify sector-wide patterns, trade-offs, and areas for improvement.)
/E (Socially, the sector presents distinct challenges related to occupational safety, contract labour, and workforce well-being. Manufacturing operations involve high exposure to physical risk, and safety outcomes are closely linked to operational continuity and reputational risk. Gender inclusion also remains a structural challenge within the sector, particularly in shop-floor roles. Given these characteristics, the automobile sector provides a suitable context for examining whether BRSR disclosures meaningfully capture sustainability performance outcomes, and whether reported data can be used to identify sector-wide patterns, trade-offs, and areas for improvement.)
/Pg 11 0 R
/K [4 5]
>>
