/T (The environment and social performance matrix reveals clear divergence in sustainability performance across companies. Tata Motors demonstrates relatively strong environmental outcomes but lags on social performance, indicating an imbalance between efficiency gains and workforce-related outcomes. Mahindra & Mahindra shows comparatively stronger social performance alongside moderate environmental outcomes, suggesting a more balanced but limited improvement across dimensions. Ashok Leyland occupies a central position, reflecting moderate performance on both fronts, while Maruti Suzuki exhibits comparatively weaker environmental outcomes despite moderate social performance. Overall, the matrix underscores that environmental and social performance do not progress)
