/E (This report was prepared as part of an academic exercise and represents original analytical work. Artificial intelligence tools were used in a limited and responsible manner to support the research process, primarily for organising ideas, improving clarity of language, and refining the presentation of content. All data collection, indicator selection, calculations, analysis, interpretation of results, and conclusions were independently carried out  using publicly disclosed BRSR reports and relevant regulatory frameworks.)
